@host = https://localhost:7267

### Check API
GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Create order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

###Create order
POST https://localhost:7267/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Cancel existing pending order
POST https://localhost:7267/orders/3/cancel
Accept: application/json
